{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------MULTIPLAYER BEING CODED RIGHT NOW-----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hangman.exe is a simple spin on the original Hangman. You must use your real-world microphone to communicate with the AI that has captured you, in order to guess the word it is thinking and be granted freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are on a timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hangman will give you 6 chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hangman can understand what you say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: REQUIRES MICROPHONE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This has been a passion project of mine for some time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My first project involving 'real-world speech' puzzle mechanics, that I hope people can enjoy for a few minutes or a few hours every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing with The Hangman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And have fun :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 -Luke</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584370?t=1747323952","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584370/b5197f87e5747651c28eba557fcb0d98bcb92d3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747323952","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584370/fcef0960021bdc6352699b98df7819e3be0c7684/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747323952","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584370/fcef0960021bdc6352699b98df7819e3be0c7684/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747323952","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is a gun on display that The Hangman can use against you. It can also be used against The Hangman.\r\n\r\nSetting is bleak and has an air of psychological horror."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------MULTIPLAYER BEING CODED RIGHT NOW-----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hangman.exe is a simple spin on the original Hangman. You must use your real-world microphone to communicate with the AI that has captured you, in order to guess the word it is thinking and be granted freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are on a timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hangman will give you 6 chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hangman can understand what you say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: REQUIRES MICROPHONE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This has been a passion project of mine for some time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My first project involving 'real-world speech' puzzle mechanics, that I hope people can enjoy for a few minutes or a few hours every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing with The Hangman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And have fun :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 -Luke</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Luke Grayson"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/